## Summary

**Remember:**
- 📝 Start with analysis doc in `.ai/docs/`
- 🎯 Minimize tests through pattern recognition
- 🏗️ Core owns HTTP/logic, wrappers own defaults/integration
- 📊 Truth tables become explicit scenarios
- 🔄 Phase 2/3 behaviors clearly separated
- ✅ Validate against old drivers at every step
- 🚫 No redundancy, no implementation details, no vagueness

**The goal:** Maximum behavior coverage with minimum scenario count, following UD architecture principles.
